tr(proc, \"pid\", None)` (100% совместимость с `FakeRun`). Контракт `should_stop, reason, _ = controller.check(proc_pid)` с реакцией на таймауты (`idle_timeout`, `absolute_cap`) и пропуском нормального выхода `child_exited`; троттлинг проверок в начале `while True:` по `controller.watchdog_interval_s`; вызов `record_activity(kind)` на `text`, `thinking` и `result`; в `@staticmethod _error_body`: перехват `st == \"timeout\"` -> 504; `try...finally` с закрытием контроллера |\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/analysis/all-bridges-sliding-activity-window/handoff-architect.md:66:       from core.watchdog import AdaptiveTimeoutController\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:29:from core.lifecycle import KeepaliveController\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:30:from core.turn_session_manager import TurnSessionManager\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:31:from core.watchdog import AdaptiveTimeoutController, ProcessWatchdog, WatchdogMetrics\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:247:    from core.lifecycle import PreSendRetry\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:273:    from core.lifecycle import PreSendRetry\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:357:    from core.backend_adapter import PreSendTransientError\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:382:    from core.backend_adapter import PreSendTransientError\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:425:    from core.backend_adapter import PreSendTransientError\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:426:    from core.lifecycle import PreSendRetry\n/Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge/tests/test_stream_resilience.py:457:    from core.backend_adapter import PreSendTransientError\n/User